  "limitations": [
    "Uses known scene boxes, shared NIST mesh and peer envelopes; no sensor feedback or unknown-obstacle protection.",
    "Horizontal braking only; no route planning or terrain protection.",
    "Only internal multirotors and fully hovering VTOL position-controlled modes; native and fixed-wing enabling rejected.",
    "Configured braking and delay are educational assumptions; wind, failed propulsion or insufficient stopping distance may still cause real simulated collisions.",
    "CP settings retained within the flight/recording, reset to disabled after page reload.",
    "Browser floating-point replay tolerance remains the existing 1e-9, not expanded for this feature.",
    "Old internal schema 1-19 and native recordings without current model marker are rejected."
  ]
